 "Site Description": "Arctic DTU operates and run the Arctic DTU Research\r\nStation. The station is part of a cooperation between the\r\nTechnical University of Denmark (DTU) and the Government of Greenland on Arctic educations, research and innovation. Buildings are owned by the Government of Greenland and provided by KTI – Tech College Greenland, the technical vocational school of Greenland.",
