 "Site Description": "BJF is located in Xiao Long Men National Forest Garden of Mentougou District, Beijing. The research objects of BJF is deciduous broad-leaved forests in warm temperate zone. Research directions include: warm temperate forest ecosystem structures and functions, the long-term dynamic of vegetation pattern, mechanism of forest population maintenance, and forest biodiversity responses to global change.",
