 ],
 "Site Description": "The study area is the legal reserve of Fazenda Miranda, which is located in the municipality of Santo Antônio do Leverger / MT. It has relevant characteristics for studies related to climatic changes, because it has a great variety of phytophysiognomies and soil textures.",
