 ],
 "Site Description": "This site is located in Gonzalo Island in Diego Ramirez Archipelago, Chile. It is a sub-Antarctic Island located at 56oS. It is a sub-Antarctic ecosystem, dominated by Poa flagellata and characterized by an absence of trees.",
 "Images": [
  "https://deims.org/sites/default/files/photos/Diego_gonzalo_Ramirez.jpg",
  "https://deims.org/sites/default/files/photos/Diego-Ramirez-Omora-Chile_4401.jpg",
