  "https://deims.org/sites/default/files/photos/Hyaena%2520with%2520GPS%2520collar%252C%2520Hwange.%2520Mael%2520Le%2520Corret.%2520Programme%2520CNRS%2520HERD_fritz_biomserv.univ-lyon1.fr_.JPG",
