 "Site Description": "The Monte Bondone station, ICOS code IT-MBo, is located on a mountain plateau, Viote del Monte Bondone, on eastern Italian Alps (Trentino Alto Adige region) at 1550 m above sea level. The area is managed as an extensive meadow with low mineral fertilisation and is cut annually in mid-July. The canopy is dominated by Festuca rubra (L.), Nardus stricta (L.), and Trifolium sp. (L.).",
