  "https://deims.org/a8da96ac-da70-457b-a66b-521f11eb017b"
 ],
 "Site Description": "Ossoue glacier (OSS) is located in the Pyrennees massif (France), between 2750 and 3210 m altitude. The glacier is one of the last glacier in this massif.This site is characterized by various glaciological parameters performed annually : annual and seasonnal mass balance, ice velocity, ice thickness variation, snout position.OSS is a part of the French Glacier Observatory GLACIOCLIM/CRYOBS-CLIM.\r\n\r\nAll the series on Ossoue glacier (OSS) are unique and necessary for glaciological studies. They permit to calibrate models in order to determine future glacier evolution",
