 "Site Description": "The research site “Piano Limina” is installed in a beech forest of the Southern Apennines. Its management history and vegetation type can be considered sufficiently representative of calabrian beech high forests.\r\nThe site is part of the Conecofor forest monitoring network since 1995-96.",
